---
source: crates/aether/tests/steps/cli/help.rs
expression: world.cli.stdout()
---
Usage: aether node direct [--data-dir <DATA_DIR>] <SUBCOMMAND>

Commands:
  import   Imports an `aether-invite:` line, or a file with an invitation or an invitation bundle.
  remove   Forgets a contact: its invitation and its stored access.
  resolve
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Flags:
      --data-dir <DATA_DIR>  Defaults to `$AETHER_DATA_DIR`, else `~/.aether/host`.
  -h, --help                 Print help
